# wait.test --
#
# This file contains a collection of tests for the wait 
# (vwait encapsulation) package.
#
# Sourcing this file into Tcl runs the tests and generates output for
# errors.  No output means no errors were found.
#
# In order for these tests to run, the "com" tcl package must be on the
# auto_path ('require'able).
#
# CONTACT:		sunscript-plugin@sunscript.sun.com
#
# AUTHORS:		Jacob Levy			Laurent Demailly
#			jyl@eng.sun.com			demailly@eng.sun.com
#			jyl@tcl-tk.com			L@demailly.com
